Scope of this license
---------------------
The MIT License below applies ONLY to the build tools written for this project: the files in tools/
(tools/*.py and tools/build.cmd), excluding everything in tools/bin/ and tools/data/.

It does NOT apply to:
- src/ - the 6502 port of the game, translated from the original Sega Master System game code;
- music/, tools/data/ and any data extracted from the original game - Sonic The Hedgehog, its characters,
  graphics, music and sound effects are the property of SEGA;
- third-party programs and files in tools/bin/ and src/data/ - see CREDITS.md and licenses/ for their
  authors and terms.

Use in any way for profit is prohibited for the game and its data: src/, music/, tools/data/, any data
extracted from the original game and the built release files (XEX, CAR, ATR). This restriction does not apply
to the MIT-licensed build tools; third-party files keep their own terms.

Sonic A8 VBXE is a non-commercial fan project and is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by SEGA.
No ROM image of the original game is included in this repository.

